ng:0pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;業務契約&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:4.4pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:8.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;物流業務の&lt;br/&gt;委託契約&lt;/p&gt;
